<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-020" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-020-xietiao-jing" source-id="s-nanqishu-020-xietiao-jing-ws2074177">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-020-xietiao-jing:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-020-xietiao-jing:p001:m0000" ref="gjl_f5h_2a6_A">明敬劉皇后</persName>諱<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-xietiao-jing:p001:m0006" ref="gjl_f5h_2a6_A">惠端</persName>，彭城人，光祿大夫<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-xietiao-jing:p001:m0017" ref="vus_7f1_rrz">道弘</persName>孫也。<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-xietiao-jing:p001:m0022" ref="47p_kjh_ez7">太祖</persName>為高宗納之。建元三年，除西昌侯夫人。永明七年，卒，葬江乘縣張山。延興元年，贈宣城王妃。高宗即位，追尊為敬皇后。贈父通直郎<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-xietiao-jing:p001:m0084" ref="gjl_f5h_2a6">景猷</persName>金紫光祿大夫，母<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-xietiao-jing:p001:m0094" ref="q20_pas_ain">王氏</persName>平陽鄉君。永泰元年，高宗崩，改葬，祔于興安陵。</p>
</text>
